# Line endings are declared, not left to each machine's git configuration.
# gradlew.bat kept coming back as a 89-line "change" that was nothing but
# CRLF against the LF stored in the repository.
#
# Deliberately narrow: no `* text=auto`, which would renormalise every file
# in the repository on the next commit that touches it.

*.bat   text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
